# VESPER HALL MASTER SUITE -- Lord Aurelian's bedroom, untouched for 50 years
# Tileset: TILESET_PLAYERS_HOUSE (Red's house). 7x5 blocks, buffer 143/1300.
# Why: the only interior set here with beds (1c) and real wooden floors.
# Entered through 2F door 17; arrive on the doormat (06).
# Holds the Lord's DIARY (portrait order clue) and the CELLAR KEY; the grey
# lady (a Misdreavus, or a MEDIUM trainer) appears here at night.
ref RedsHouse1F
tileset players_house
key W=01 .=03 w=05 M=06 a=08 B=1b Z=1c
grid:
BWwBwWB
.......
Z.....Z
..a.a..
...M...
end
exit DOOR 6 9
exit DOOR2 7 9
obj sign 5 7 Diary
obj item 12 2 CellarKey
obj npc 8 3 GreyLady down
obj sign 0 1 Bookcase
